sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant App as Web App
    participant Redis as Redis Session Store

    User->>App: Login request
    App->>Redis: Create session
    Redis->>App: Session ID
    App->>User: Set session cookie

    User->>App: Subsequent request with cookie
    App->>Redis: Get session data
    Redis->>App: Session data
    App->>User: Authorized response

    User->>App: Logout request
    App->>Redis: Delete session
    Redis->>App: Confirmation
    App->>User: Clear session cookie